* 74HC00: una compuerta NAND de 2 entradas (de las 4 del integrado), a transistores.
* Valores típicos a 25 °C. Tres etapas, como la compuerta real con buffer:
* NAND de entrada -> inversor -> etapa de salida.
* Modelos MOS (UCB level 3, NXP "HIGH-SPEED CMOS Logic Family") y etapa de salida OUTUN
* tomados de TCLib/74HCU04.lib (J. Petrucci, basado en hc_tnomi_nxp.lib).
*
*              A  B  Y  VCC GND
.SUBCKT 74HC00 A  B  Y  VCC GND
* encapsulado
L1 VCC nv 6.87n
L2 ng GND 6.87n
L3 A na 5.97n
L4 B nb 5.97n
L5 ny Y 5.97n
C1 nv GND 1.5p
C2 ng GND 1.5p
C3 na GND 1.5p
C4 nb GND 1.5p
C5 Y GND 1.5p
* NAND de entrada. PMOS el doble de ancho que en el inversor de entrada del 74HCU04: umbral ~0,48·VCC
MP1 n1 na nv nv MHCPEN_HC00 W=40U L=2.4U AD=200P AS=200P PD=60U PS=20U
MP2 n1 nb nv nv MHCPEN_HC00 W=40U L=2.4U AD=200P AS=200P PD=60U PS=20U
MN1 n1 na nm ng MHCNEN_HC00 W=35U L=2.4U AD=260P AS=260P PD=70U PS=20U
MN2 nm nb ng ng MHCNEN_HC00 W=35U L=2.4U AD=260P AS=260P PD=70U PS=20U
* inversor intermedio
MP3 n2 n1 nv nv MHCPEN_HC00 W=20U L=2.4U AD=100P AS=100P PD=40U PS=20U
MN3 n2 n1 ng ng MHCNEN_HC00 W=35U L=2.4U AD=260P AS=260P PD=70U PS=20U
* etapa de salida (invierte)
XO n2 ny nv ng OUTUN_HC00
.ENDS

.SUBCKT OUTUN_HC00 2  3  50  60
*IN=2, OUT=3, VCC=50, GND=60
R1  2 4 100
MP1 3 4 50 50  MHCPEN_HC00 W=485U L=2.4U AD=1200P AS=530P PD=10U PS=180U
MN1 3 4 60 60  MHCNEN_HC00 W=222U L=2.4U AD=530P AS=300P PD=10U PS=130U
R2  4 5 50
MP2 3 5 50 50  MHCPEN_HC00 W=485U L=2.4U AD=1200P AS=530P PD=10U PS=180U
MN2 3 5 60 60  MHCNEN_HC00 W=222U L=2.4U AD=530P AS=300P PD=10U PS=130U
R3  5 6 50
MP3 3 6 50 50  MHCPEN_HC00 W=485U L=2.4U AD=1200P AS=530P PD=10U PS=180U
MN3 3 6 60 60  MHCNEN_HC00 W=222U L=2.4U AD=530P AS=300P PD=10U PS=130U
.ENDS

***********************************************
*        NOMINAL P-Channel transistor         *
*           UCB-3 Parameter Set               *
*         HIGH-SPEED CMOS Logic Family        *
*               10-Jan.-1995                  *
***********************************************
.Model MHCPEN_HC00 PMOS
+LEVEL = 3
+KP    = 22.1E-6
+VTO   = -0.71
+TOX   = 51.5E-9
+NSUB  = 3.3E16
+GAMMA = 0.92
+PHI   = 0.65
+VMAX  = 970E3
+RS    = 80
+RD    = 80
+XJ    = 0.63E-6
+LD    = 0.23E-6
+DELTA = 2.24
+THETA = 0.108
+ETA   = 0.322
+KAPPA = 0.0
+WD    = 0.0

************************************************
*         NOMINAL N-Channel Transistor         *
*            UCB-3 Parameter Set               *
*         HIGH-SPEED CMOS Logic Family         *
*                10-Jan.-1995                  *
************************************************
.Model MHCNEN_HC00 NMOS
+LEVEL = 3
+KP    = 45.3E-6
+VTO   = 0.72
+TOX   = 51.5E-9
+NSUB  = 2.8E15
+GAMMA = 0.94
+PHI   = 0.65
+VMAX  = 150E3
+RS    = 40
+RD    = 40
+XJ    = 0.11E-6
+LD    = 0.52E-6
+DELTA = 0.315
+THETA = 0.054
+ETA   = 0.025
+KAPPA = 0.0
+WD    = 0.0